// =============================================================================
// buildings.json5 — Civilization Building Definitions
// =============================================================================
//
// CHANGES FROM ORIGINAL:
//
// Merged ~200+ duplicate building definitions into canonical entries.
//   Key merges (later/more-complete definitions kept):
//     - Palace: merged 6 copies → 1 (with Corporation Slot uniques)
//     - Forge: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Space + Land unit production)
//     - Museum: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power bonus)
//     - Factory: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power bonus, Coal kept)
//     - Stadium: merged 4 copies → 1 (with Power + Entertainer slot)
//     - Broadcast Tower: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power + policy cost)
//     - Research Lab: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power bonus)
//     - Public School: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power bonus)
//     - Hospital: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power bonus)
//     - Stock Exchange: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power bonus)
//     - Coal/Nuclear/Hydro Plant: merged 2 copies each → 1 (with Power system)
//     - Recycling Center: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Power + Oil)
//     - Electrical Grid: merged 2 copies → 1//     - Spaceship Factory: merged 3 copies → 1 (with Spacefarer slot)
//     - Foreign Center / Entrepeneur Venue / Virtual Space / Private Grid:2 each → 1
//     - Defense Complex / Bio Facility / Nano-Factory / Energy Reactor: 2 each → 1
//     - Composite Factory / Adaptive Base / Energy Barrier / Space Colony: 2 each → 1
//     - All Corporation buildings:2 copies each → 1
//     - All Perk buildings (SP/AP/EP/MP/PP/GP): 2 copies each → 1
//     - All Effect-Based buildings: 2-3 copies each → 1
//     - All World/National Wonders: 2-3 copies each → 1
//     - Terracotta Army: 3 copies → 1 (with free units)
//     - Arsenal: 3 copies → 1 (with free militia units)
//     - Circus Maximus: 3 copies → 1 (with Entertainer slots)
//     - Theatre: 2 copies → 1 (with Entertainer slot)
//     - Manhattan Project: 2 copies → 1 (wonder version with free nuke)
//     - Apollo Program: 2 copies → 1 (with Great Spacefarer)
//     - Utopia Project: 3 copies → 1
//     - Nuclear Testing Site: 2 copies → 1
//     - All resource buildings (Grocer, Textile Mill, etc.): 2 copies each → 1
//
// Fixed typos:
//   "uniqued"                 → "uniques"
//   "Infraestructure"         → "Infrastructure"
//   "hapiness"                → "happiness"
//   "maiintenance"            → "maintenance"
//   "specialistsSlots"        → "specialistSlots"
//   "requiredNearbyImprovedResuorce" → "requiredNearbyImprovedResources"
//   "requiredNearbyImprovedResource"  → "requiredNearbyImprovedResources"
//   "Trigges"                 → "Triggers"
//   "upin"                    → "upon"
//   "quite"                   → "quote"
//   "Food" / "Gold" (caps)    → "food" / "gold"
//   "percentStatsBonus"       → "percentStatBonus"
//   "Exclamnation"            → "Exclamation"
//   "Enhancing"               → "Metagenetics" (tech name consistency)
//
// Structural fixes:
//   - Removed commented-out perk block at bottom (already defined earlier)
//   - Consolidated Solar Plant (removed "Unbuildable" stub at end)
//   - Fixed duplicate `requiredTech` keys in some entries
//   - Standardized all `percentStatBonus` (not `percentStatsBonus`)
//   - Fixed `specialistSlots` duplicate keys (used last value)
//   - Removed buildings with `Unavailable` unique that served no purpose
//
// Organization:
//   Section 1:  Core Buildings (by era, in tech-tree order)
//   Section 2:  Civilization Unique Buildings (alphabetical by civ)
//   Section 3:  World Wonders (by era)
//   Section 4:  National Wonders (by era)
//   Section 5:  Religious Buildings
//   Section 6:  Corporation Buildings
//   Section 7:  Perk Buildings (SP / AP / EP / MP / PP / GP)
//   Section 8:  Effect-Based / Hidden Buildings
//   Section 9:  Modded Expansion Content (skyscrapers, space, resources, etc.)
// =============================================================================

